parent assault of  gerudo town from the yiga clan  or the existence of potentially more  than one sheikah slate  but more than this we need and i stress  this very fervently  we need these answers to be confirmed as  canon  because even though this game was  directly requested to be made from mr  aonuma himself  and even though it takes place in the  same universe with the same characters  as the original game  there are still people out there who  will either debate the canon of this  game or who will use this game's canon  status to reflect upon the original  hyrule warriors  nintendo has stated that the first game  was not canon  so i think they need to similarly state  that this one is  it just has to happen it can't be left  up to debate a good way to do this would  be to slot it in behind breath of the  wild on the timeline  that would clear up any confusion over  whether or not its events are actually  canon and would also solidify its place  as the first  non-legend of zelda title in the zelda  timeline secondly  i want to see some variation to the  warriors hack and slash kind of gameplay  don't get me wrong  it's fun it's a lot of fun actually  especially when you mix in a whole bunch  of different characters with different  movesets and weapons  but choosing one of the many overpowered  characters and spamming the attack  button four times in a row over and over  until you can smash the final move and  then rinse and repeat until the  battleground is cleared gets  kind of old after a while if it did  release and had the same  intermission clear enemies repeat style  of gameplay i'd be  okay but would honestly only play it for  the story at that point and would  probably not keep it up afterwards  but if they introduced other objectives  like maybe collectibles or exploration  or good old-fashioned zelda puzzles  that would be much more likely to keep  people playing the game for longer and  speaking of varied gameplay  i'd like to see some varied missions in  the game one would think that since this  game will be covering the absolute loss  to calamity ganon years ago there might  be some missions that include not  obliterating every enemy on the  battlefield but  rather maybe trying to evacuate  civilians from neighboring towns  or maybe even towards the end of the  game getting a mission that plays  through link's final moments before  entering his slumber for a hundred years  that entailed having to run away with  zelda now that  would be cool and i know it would also  be completely out of the ordinary for a  warriors game but if we could get a few  missions as the champions becoming the  champions and having to maybe go through  not enemies but  trials to prove themselves again that  would be cool and would serve to mix up  the kinds of missions that you have to  embark on to keep players enthusiastic  about pressing that start button  because as you know warriors games are  not generally open world  they're mission based and are launched  from a menu screen but  speaking of the menu screen fourthly i'd  like to see instead of launching from a  menu  maybe a hub world that you can launch  into missions from  this would serve to immerse players into  the world of pre-calamity hyrule better  than ever before  just imagine if you're going through  lynx missions and your hub world is  hyrule castle not only can you explore  the castle but you could walk over to  zelda to enter a research mission or to  the king to enter a battleground mission  or maybe even pulling some inspiration  from monster hunter world and walking to  the front gates to enter like a free  roam session of the entire world  where there could be any number of world  events to take place in or places to  explore that don't necessarily further  the story but would just serve to  generate drops for materials or other  such loot  and what if every champion had their own  hub world like playing as mifa meant you  had a similar setup in zoro's domain or  playing as rivali  not sure why you'd be playing as that  person but  that would result in rideau village as a  hub world daruk and urbosa would have  goron city and gerudo town as well etc  etc  maybe i'm dreaming too largely but hey  with the way that they shadow dropped  this game in the first place  anything is possible and hub worlds are  a more modern take on gaming and would  really make the experience of this game  something unforgettable finally i'd like  to see or rather  hear a fantastic soundtrack and you  might be thinking oh  that's a lame choice but excuse you  music is incredibly important to the  impact a game has  zelda games are known for their music  and the first hyrule warriors completely  knocked it out of the park with not only  upbeat remixes of classic zelda tunes  but also some straight fire original  tracks like  this one  do you have goosebumps because i have  goosebumps i cannot wait to hear a remix  for hyrule castle or mifa's theme or  maybe some original emotional music for  that last mission when zelda sacrifices  herself to save everyone 100 years in  the future  can you tell i'm hyped am i being  obvious and there you have it guys  my brief list of 5 things i'd like to  either return or be changed in hyrule  warriors age of calamity i'm sure most  of these have already been determined  since the game is being demoed later  this month  and will release in just two short  months so either way we'll see soon how  many of these became reality  in the meantime though if you agree with  this list or maybe have some other  expectations for the game let me know in  the comments below like i said i'll be  gone for a few weeks but i look forward  to going through your comments when i  get back oh and be sure to smash those  like and subscribe buttons so this video  spreads around and i can meet all sorts  of people when i get back  also huge thanks to my supporters i have  several new names to announce this time  around  say hello to executives links anthony y  melli bear merlin the witch tilda e  and doggo you guys all amaze me and i  can't thank you enough  if you watching are interested in  helping the next video come to life and  expanding the content of this channel  click that join button below this video  or visit the links in the description  below to find out how  also down there are the links to my  social media pages and i'm like super  close to 3 000 followers on twitter so  why not come on over and say hi  that's all i've got for this one so as  always you guys be good while i'm gone  okay  keep the hype real this is  mastentindabanit signing out  see you soon  [Music]  you
 

